me":"ラウマ","textMapHash":4229601138,"text":"ヤフォダさんには本当に世話になったな…前にも言ったように、もう一人護衛をつけたほうがよさそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[766690112]},{"nodeId":766690112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7058,"speakerName":"リーリキ","textMapHash":1153940306,"text":"あ、いえいえ、人手は足りていますし、護衛を雇うぐらいなら、配給所を増やしたほうがいいと思います。","nextNodeIds":[766690113]},{"nodeId":766690113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7058,"speakerName":"リーリキ","textMapHash":2339702490,"text":"ヤフォダさんが時々見に来てくれていますし、カントールさんもいます。騒ぎを起こす人はもういないはずなので、ご安心ください。","nextNodeIds":[766690114]},{"nodeId":766690114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1987498682,"text":"そうだとよいが…こうしよう。私の友を交代で来させる。もし困ったことがあれば、彼らに言うとよい。","nextNodeIds":[766690115]},{"nodeId":766690115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7058,"speakerName":"リーリキ","textMapHash":957738426,"text":"お友達？島の方でしょうか？","nextNodeIds":[766690116]},{"nodeId":766690116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":2413286650,"text":"ふふ、きっと見覚えがあるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[766690117]},{"nodeId":766690117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":57582546,"text":"これ以上邪魔はしないでいこう。では、月神の恩寵があらんことを。","nextNodeIds":[766690118]},{"nodeId":766690118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7058,"speakerName":"リーリキ","textMapHash":1055800882,"text":"はい！お気をつけて、ラウマ様！","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7666902,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":true,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":4,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":fa